of very high quality documents.

38
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:54,880
And we also want very large diversity of documents

39
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:58,040
because we want to have a lot of knowledge inside these models.

40
00:01:58,040 --> 00:02:01,240
So we want large diversity of high quality documents

41
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:02,840
and we want many, many of them.

42
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:05,000
And achieving this is quite complicated.

