00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:08,610
2.7 billion web pages, and they have all these crawlers

65
00:03:08,610 --> 00:03:09,650
going around the internet.

66
00:03:09,650 --> 00:03:10,850
And what you end up doing basically

67
00:03:10,850 --> 00:03:13,170
is you start with a few seed web pages,

68
00:03:13,170 --> 00:03:14,730
and then you follow all the links.

69
00:03:14,730 --> 00:03:15,850
And you just keep following links,

70
00:03:15,850 --> 00:03:17,290
and you keep indexing all the information,

71
00:03:17,290 --> 00:03:20,330
and you end up with a ton of data of the internet over time.

72
00:03:20,330 --> 00:03:25,490
So this is usually the starting point for a lot of these efforts.

