00:32:00,350 --> 00:32:02,330
to highlight are as follows.

599
00:32:02,330 --> 00:32:04,290
GPT2 was a transformer neural network,

600
00:32:04,290 --> 00:32:08,470
just like the neural networks you would work with today.

