00:33:09,340 --> 00:33:12,060
As I mentioned, the fine web data set that we looked at here,

625
00:33:12,060 --> 00:33:14,780
The final database that has 15 trillion tokens,

626
00:33:14,780 --> 00:33:17,880
so 100 billion is quite small.

