00:34:20,090 --> 00:34:23,650
and really squeezing out all the speed from the hardware

650
00:34:23,650 --> 00:34:25,450
as it is possible,

651
00:34:25,450 --> 00:34:27,650
that software has also gotten much better

652
00:34:27,650 --> 00:34:29,210
as everyone has focused on these models

653
00:34:29,210 --> 00:34:32,390
and trying to run them very, very quickly.

