00:35:18,330 --> 00:35:22,890
So here every single line is one update to the neural network where we change its parameters

673
00:35:22,890 --> 00:35:27,250
by a little bit so that it is better at predicting the next token in the sequence.

674
00:35:27,250 --> 00:35:34,130
In particular, every single line here is improving the prediction on one million tokens in the

675
00:35:34,130 --> 00:35:35,860
training set.

676
00:35:35,860 --> 00:35:42,130
So we've basically taken one million tokens out of this data set and we've tried to improve

677
00:35:42,130 --> 00:35:48,290
the prediction of that token as coming next in a sequence on all one million of them simultaneously.

678
00:35:49,890 --> 00:35:53,570
And at every single one of these steps, we are making an update to the network for that.

679
00:35:54,840 --> 00:36:00,600
Now the number to watch closely is this number called loss. And the loss is a single number

