00:36:00,600 --> 00:36:06,440
that is telling you how well your neural network is performing right now. And it is created so that

681
00:36:06,440 --> 00:36:12,440
low loss is good. So you'll see that the loss is decreasing as we make more updates to the neural

682
00:36:12,440 --> 00:36:17,480
not, which corresponds to making better predictions on a next token in a sequence.

